00:22:09,760 --> 00:22:15,700
so say here, the next, not the if, but the else,

234
00:22:15,700 --> 00:22:21,540
so we say else if the neighborhood of the vertex in the graph

235
00:22:22,800 --> 00:22:27,760
minus the seen vertices in the state,

236
00:22:28,120 --> 00:22:32,680
so we have this variable called seen here, so we take that variable,

