00:26:55,160 --> 00:27:04,540
which is one, two,

303
00:27:06,220 --> 00:27:08,500
three, and four.

304
00:27:09,740 --> 00:27:14,580
This is basically the idea of modeling a while loop as a recursive call,

305
00:27:15,900 --> 00:27:20,520
and that idea is actually quite standard.

